      "inherited_provenance": {
        "turn_number": 1,
        "accepted_source_line": 17,
        "verbatim_accepted_section": "### Matchmaking and setup, about 0–38 seconds\n\nDacz8976 matches with Cool Hand and is assigned second turn. The owner's opening hand is visibly **Eevee, Small Balloon, Copycat, Professor's Research, and Poke Ball** (`024-opening-hand-going-second.jpg`). The owner sets the only Basic, Eevee, Active; Cool Hand sets a lone Bulbasaur Active and has no Benched Pokémon.\n\nThe enlarged Eevee at about 28 seconds and Bulbasaur at about 32 seconds are setup inspections, not plays (`029-eevee-setup-inspection.jpg`, `033-bulbasaur-setup-inspection.jpg`). Both boards begin with no Energy and the score is 0–0.\n\n### Cool Hand turn 1, about 39–49 seconds\n\nThe opponent's turn draw is hidden. Cool Hand plays **Heavy Helmet** onto Bulbasaur (`045-heavy-helmet-play.jpg`). Bulbasaur receives no Energy and makes no attack; the opponent ends the turn with the same lone Active and no Bench. Heavy Helmet is attached, but its damage-reduction condition is not yet active on Bulbasaur.",
