      "inherited_provenance": {
        "turn_number": 2,
        "accepted_source_line": 27,
        "verbatim_accepted_section": "### Dacz8976 turn 2, about 50–102 seconds\n\nThe owner's visible turn draw is **Mega Altaria ex** (`051-owner-turn-draw-mega-altaria.jpg`). The following sequence is directly observable:\n\n1. **Poke Ball** is played and returns **Darkrai** from the deck (`055-owner-poke-ball-play.jpg`, `058-owner-poke-ball-darkrai.jpg`).\n2. **Professor's Research** is played and draws **Swablu** and **Training Area** (`061-owner-research-play.jpg`, `065-owner-research-swablu.jpg`, `066-owner-research-training-area.jpg`).\n3. The owner Benches Swablu and then Darkrai (`075-owner-developed-board.jpg`).\n4. **Small Balloon** is attached to Eevee (`081-small-balloon-attached.jpg`). Its retreat reduction makes Eevee's one-Energy retreat cost zero, so Eevee retreats for Swablu without an Energy discard (`085-free-retreat-prompt.jpg`).\n5. The owner's first generated **Psychic Energy** is attached to Active Swablu (`088-first-psychic-to-swablu.jpg`).\n6. Swablu uses **Sing**, making Bulbasaur Asleep (`093-sing-asleep.jpg`).\n7. At the end of the turn, Benched Darkrai's **Bad Dreams** places 20 damage on the opponent's Active Pokémon, moving Bulbasaur from 60 to 40 HP. The settled 40-HP state is visible (`102-bad-dreams-settled-40hp.jpg`).\n8. The between-turns Sleep check is **Tails**, so Bulbasaur remains Asleep (`101-sleep-check-tails.jpg`).\n\nEnd state: Active Swablu has 50 HP and one Psychic Energy; Benched Eevee has 50 HP and Small Balloon; Benched Darkrai has 100 HP and no Energy. The owner holds Copycat, Mega Altaria ex, and Training Area. Cool Hand has lone Active Bulbasaur at 40 HP, Asleep, with Heavy Helmet attached and no Energy. Score remains 0–0.",
        "basis": "inherited accepted prose, not completed new source observation"
      },
