      "inherited_provenance": {
        "turn_number": 4,
        "accepted_source_line": 54,
        "verbatim_accepted_section": "### Dacz8976 turn 4, about 132–161 seconds\n\nThe owner's visible turn draw is **Field Blower** (`133-owner-turn-draw-field-blower.jpg`). The exact order is decisive:\n\n1. The owner plays **Field Blower**, selects the attached Heavy Helmet, and discards it (`136-field-blower-play.jpg`, `138-field-blower-targets-helmet.jpg`, `140-heavy-helmet-discarded.jpg`). Heavy Helmet is readable in the opponent's discard; its identity is no longer uncertain.\n2. Active Swablu evolves into **Mega Altaria ex**, carrying forward its first Psychic Energy (`144-mega-altaria-evolution.jpg`).\n3. The owner plays **Training Area**, which settles into the Stadium zone (`149-training-area-play.jpg`).\n4. The second generated **Psychic Energy** is attached to Mega Altaria ex, leaving it with two Psychic Energy (`150-second-psychic-attachment.jpg`, `154-mega-harmony-displays-110.jpg`).\n5. The attack interface displays **Mega Harmony — 110**. Mega Harmony deals 40 plus 30 for each owner Benched Pokémon. Eevee and Darkrai are the two Benched Pokémon, so its base result is `40 + 30 + 30 = 100`; Training Area adds 10 for the displayed 110 (`154-mega-harmony-displays-110.jpg`).\n6. The game warns that a Supporter remains usable. **Copycat** is visibly the owner's only hand card; the owner leaves it unplayed and confirms the attack (`155-copycat-unused-warning.jpg`).\n7. Mega Harmony hits for 110 and Ivysaur reaches 0 HP (`159-mega-harmony-damage.jpg`, `160-ivysaur-zero-hp.jpg`).",
